{"id":"vod_md_2569","vodId":"2569","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"TARI TARI","name_cn":"TARI TARI","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230816-1/e0e71f9439c1b54e033bcada597e5550.jpg"},"summary":"曾经热爱唱歌的坂井和奏（高桓彩阳 配音）在母亲去世后就此紧闭了双唇，愧疚和悔恨一直折磨着她脆弱的灵魂，这也导致本来在年音乐特长班的她转到了普通班。一次偶然中，和奏认识了同班同学宫本来夏（瀬户麻沙美 配音），来夏对音乐的热爱感染了和奏，也唤起了她对于音乐久违的热情。冲田妙羽（早见沙织 配音）的出现彻底奠定了和奏重拾音乐的决心，合唱部应运而生。随着维也纳转学生前田敦博（花江夏树 配音）的出现，合唱部的人气达到了顶峰，有了音乐的每一天，和奏都和伙伴们快乐的渡过着，母亲坂井真昼（大原沙耶香 配音）给和奏带来的困扰也逐渐的转化为了生活的动力。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-16 09:24:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/heXM0aFY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/Sd4TRH14/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/qwmjQT6f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/WuP1p0SI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/dTaFSFI3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/6JOXCgoy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/xI6E6Xup/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/ZV1R92IQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/761XAPy9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/VyORHqV0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/lCLeYINC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/NtinGpGM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/YkQvrDOm/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:10.768Z"}